## Install

1. Drop the `Scripts/` folder into your project's `Assets/`.
2. Add the `{{ s.name }}` component to anything that can take damage (player, enemy, destructible).
3. Call `TakeDamage(amount)` / `Heal(amount)`; read `CurrentHealth` / `MaxHealth`.
4. Wire the events — e.g. to the HUD `health_bar` micro:

```csharp
var hp  = GetComponent<{{ s.name }}>();
hp.OnHealthChanged += hud.SetHealth;   // (current, max)
hp.OnDeath         += () => Debug.Log("dead");
```

(The composition layer wires `OnHealthChanged → HUD.SetHealth` automatically when both are present.)

